<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Commerce cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Commerce cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded First Commerce Corp to neutral from buy, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 1-3/4 to 34-1/4.</p>
